  <diagram id="auction-csl-verification" name="02 - Verification boundary and source mapping">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1390" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1390" background="#FFFFFF" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="audit_title" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;AUCTION / verification coverage and semantic limits&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=29;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="28" width="1690" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="coverage_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="115" width="820" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="coverage" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;1 / State supplied by the CSL core&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Auction::start(service) reads running and writes running/task.&lt;br&gt;Auction::bid(amount) reads running; an improving bid updates&lt;br&gt;best_bid/currentWinner. A successful losing bid can change no state.&lt;br&gt;Auction::stop() reads running, sets it false and publishes winner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The five supplied Auction operation pre/post clauses have the&lt;br&gt;required Boolean/String state. Their operation signatures belong&lt;br&gt;to the execution/USE adapter, not CSL structural declarations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;String task represents the service description. winner remains a&lt;br&gt;String encoding the source Atom, including no_winner." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="77" y="135" width="776" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="external_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="925" y="115" width="820" height="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="external" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;2 / Required external observer state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AuctionMonitor&lt;/b&gt; / SchemeOrder and BidEvidence:&lt;br&gt;startSatisfiedAt, bidEnabledAt, bidSatisfiedAt,&lt;br&gt;decideEnabledAt, decideSatisfiedAt, now;&lt;br&gt;bidCommittedBy, bidDoneBy, actualBidBy; adminBidOverride.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AuctionObligation&lt;/b&gt; / WithinDeadline:&lt;br&gt;goal, activatedAt, deadlineAt, endedAt, unfulfilled, monitor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;These are event/deontic trace projections. They are deliberately&lt;br&gt;not Entity classes or an Association in CSL core.&lt;br&gt;Role players are not the same set as mission-committed bidders.&lt;br&gt;step.enabled / step.succeeded and agent-artifact focus also&lt;br&gt;remain runtime evidence. The supplied OCL contains no @pre.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No Auction snapshot can prove a non-improving actual bid&lt;br&gt;occurred, or reconstruct the 10 s / 1 h obligation history." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="947" y="135" width="776" height="395" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="decisions_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="495" width="820" height="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="decisions" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;3 / KEEP, MODIFY, REMOVE, ADD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;KEEP:&lt;/b&gt; auctionGroup, auctioneer, participant, Auction,&lt;br&gt;id and the four observable properties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MODIFY:&lt;/b&gt; CSL notation; types, mutability and identifier origin;&lt;br&gt;separate role-population bounds from declaration containment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;REMOVE:&lt;/b&gt; Bid with amount/bidderName; opens-closes,&lt;br&gt;submits, offers, and the untyped auction-sessions association.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ADD:&lt;/b&gt; root AuctionOrg, explicit OrgCtx declaration nesting,&lt;br&gt;persistent source field currentWinner, source population Phi.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No Service Entity: source stores only a String.&lt;br&gt;No winner-to-Role association: source stores an agent-name Atom.&lt;br&gt;No subgroup, Role inheritance, Compatibility, or Role-to-Role Link&lt;br&gt;is declared by this case study. No Goal/Mission/Norm is a CSL node." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="77" y="515" width="776" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="integration_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="925" y="580" width="820" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="integration" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;4 / Integration limits verified in use4Goal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The v4 grammar/compiler supports structural parse, reference&lt;br&gt;validation, and scalar attributes. It declares no operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CslModel.requireLegacyRuntime rejects a v4 model in the&lt;br&gt;legacy CSL-to-USE/runtime backend. A valid CSL diagram is&lt;br&gt;not evidence of a completed executable bridge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The iStar organization Actor Auction needs an explicit context&lt;br&gt;correspondence. A direct OrgCtx mapping does not by itself&lt;br&gt;satisfy the paper&#39;s total Actor-to-Role rule in Definition 4(iii).&lt;br&gt;No artificial coordinator Role is introduced to hide that gap.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Binding each Task to Auction.id and its invocation is required&lt;br&gt;for concurrent a1/a2; self:Auction is not automatically the&lt;br&gt;paper&#39;s shared self:c:OrgCtx convention." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="947" y="600" width="776" height="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="source_trace_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="895" width="820" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="source_trace" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;5 / Source and notation evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mandatory local Auction folder:&lt;br&gt;auction.jcm:8-31; src/org/auction-os.xml:14-50.&lt;br&gt;src/agt/auction_capabilities.asl:2-13,19-42,53-57.&lt;br&gt;src/env/auction_env/AuctionArtifact.java:8-44.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Paper: IV-A/IV-C, Fig. 6-7 and ProposalReview (pages 2-4).&lt;br&gt;use4Goal: docs/model/csl.ecore; CSL.g4; CslBuildingVisitor;&lt;br&gt;CslModelFactory; CslSemanticValidator; CslLayoutBuilder;&lt;br&gt;CslUseViewModel; CslModel.requireLegacyRuntime.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ProposalReview records persistent revisions/reviews/validations.&lt;br&gt;Auction has no corresponding stored Bid record; no such Entity&lt;br&gt;or action-derived structural Association is copied mechanically." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="77" y="915" width="776" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="numeric_identity_box" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="925" y="990" width="820" height="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="numeric_identity" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;6 / Explicit abstractions and observation limits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;id projects CArtAgO artifact-name metadata via scheme Id.&lt;br&gt;AuctionOrg is model scope, not physical workspace containment.&lt;br&gt;currentWinner exists in Java but is not observable; extracting it&lt;br&gt;requires explicit access/instrumentation. The current OCL does&lt;br&gt;not read it; it records the candidate-to-published-winner semantics.&lt;br&gt;Java double / Atom are projected to USE Real / String.&lt;br&gt;Preserve Double.MAX_VALUE, or declare a justified finite-domain&lt;br&gt;abstraction separately. No zero/default or artificial Bid history&lt;br&gt;is substituted." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="947" y="1010" width="776" height="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="audit_footer" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Coverage verdict:&lt;/b&gt; organizational declarations and source domain state are represented. Domain operation guards/effects can use Auction state. Full goal/task/deadline verification still requires explicit correspondences, execution evidence and the v4 runtime adapter; observer helpers are not part of this CSL model." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="1285" width="1690" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
